# _site is GENERATED output (built in the sandbox by bin/csr-build), committed
# verbatim for deploy. Mark it linguist-generated so the dist-ai-style gate skips
# its STYLE/format rules (it would otherwise rewrite the rendered HTML and drift
# from the generator's output); the secret / structural checks still apply.
# GitHub also collapses it in diffs and excludes it from language stats.
_site/** linguist-generated
# The Pages deploy serves the raw committed _site bytes (build_type=workflow, no
# CI rebuild), so its inlined-asset HTML cannot move to git-lfs and legitimately
# exceeds check-added-large-files' 500 KiB. Mark it a deliberately-committed large
# artifact so the add-size gate skips it (opt-in; every other path default-denies).
_site/** dist-ai-large-ok
